Commit:     Eric W. Biederman <ebiederm@xmission.com>
CommitDate: Sun Nov 25 16:25:18 2018 -0600

    vfs: Introduce sb_parameters to simplify mount argument passing
    =

    - Place the definition in include/linux/fs.h
    - Place the declaration of the helper functions in include/linux/mount.h
    =

    There are all kinds of things that are performed generically in the
    current mount code but the structure is awkward because it is
    difficult to pass things through the different functions that together
    perform the mount operation.
    =

    The structure sb_parameters is for all of the generic options that are
    parsed in one location but are needed in another.  Options that only
    the filesystem understands are not handled in this structure.
    =

    Signed-off-by: "Eric W. Biederman" <ebiederm@xmission.com>

